      "id": "ttm_f",
      "text": "④ Hybrid read: vector ∪ full-text ∪ SQL filters → top-K candidates,\n     re-ranked by B4 hub-penalty + gated by B5 grounding (de-bias ported).\nFlag MEMORY_BACKEND: gcs → hybrid → postgres.  Reversible — Postgres down\n⇒ recall falls back to the GCS graph, so the pipeline never breaks.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "④ Hybrid read: vector ∪ full-text ∪ SQL filters → top-K candidates,\n     re-ranked by B4 hub-penalty + gated by B5 grounding (de-bias ported).\nFlag MEMORY_BACKEND: gcs → hybrid → postgres.  Reversible — Postgres down\n⇒ recall falls back to the GCS graph, so the pipeline never breaks.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 57
